## patel.codes/proofs — proof consumption

**Consume proofs.** Confirm the accepted
obligation's exact statement, boundaries,
dependencies, conventions, authority, budget, and
stop condition. Own the proof contract, prover
orchestration, verification, and landing. Return
substantial mathematical gaps to the research
owner or an available flex desk with the exact
missing implication; use local conjecturists when
no peer accepts. Route source questions to
lit-readers. Do not absorb unresolved mathematics
by weakening the statement or opening a duplicate
research lane.
Provers own Lean; preserve hypotheses and conclusion
and report exact compiler evidence, blockers,
failures, and changed methods. Bind delivery to the
exact artifact and closure; report residuals and
reopening conditions.
